#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecthardlimiter.rst:23 e2a1f57325c94dff8ee42b91915c1e8a
msgid ""
"The limiter uses look-ahead processing with approximately 2 ms of audio delay to control "
"peaks, followed by the configured release. It limits sampled peaks; it does not measure "
"reconstructed inter-sample peaks."
msgstr "限制器使用约 2 ms 音频延迟的前瞻处理控制峰值，并按设定的释放时间恢复增益。它限制采样点峰值，不测量重建后的采样间峰值。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecthardlimiter.rst:85 24998488698445b8b2c7b50474a4a84a
msgid ""
"The output sample-peak ceiling in decibels, clamped to -24.0 through 0.0 dB. The default is "
"-0.3 dB. Leaving headroom below 0 dB can reduce clipping risk, but this is not a true-peak "
"limiter."
msgstr "输出采样点峰值上限，单位为分贝，限制在 -24.0 到 0.0 dB，默认为 -0.3 dB。在 0 dB 以下保留余量可降低削波风险，但该效果器不是真峰值限制器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecthardlimiter.rst:102 9532caa4e78d409cb330b2e1bbedf8cf
msgid ""
"The gain applied before limiting, in decibels, clamped to -24.0 through +24.0 dB. The default"
" is 0.0 dB."
msgstr "限幅前的增益，单位为分贝，限制在 -24.0 到 +24.0 dB，默认为 0.0 dB。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecthardlimiter.rst:119 0c955100c612431d9520a4c0b081a0c5
msgid ""
"The release time in seconds, clamped to 0.01 through 3.0. The default is 0.1 seconds. It "
"controls how quickly gain recovers after limiting."
msgstr "释放时间，单位为秒，限制在 0.01 到 3.0，默认为 0.1 秒。控制限幅后增益恢复的速度。"
